= Instructions

Add the @Rye whiskey{2 oz}, @Sweet vermouth{1 oz}, and @Angostura bitters{2 dashes} into a 
#Mixing glass{} with @Ice{} and stir until well-chilled.

Strain into a chilled #Nick & Nora or coupe glass{}.

Garnish with a @Brandied cherry{} or a @Lemon twist{}, if preferred.